  "papyrus.home.new.title": "Papyrus: Give a New Reach to Your Work",
  "papyrus.home.new.description": "Papyrus is the institutional repository of the Université de Montréal. It provides open access to theses and dissertations submitted at UdeM, as well as research work from the UdeM community (scholarly journal articles, book chapters, etc.). It serves as the platform for preserving and disseminating the scholarly output of the UdeM community.",
